@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@phone = 13800138000
@code = 替换为Redis中的6位验证码
@token = 替换为登录返回的Token
@password = 替换为8到64位密码
@requestId = reservation-demo-001
@reservationId = 替换为预约返回的预约号
@orderId = 替换为预约查询结果中的orderId
@waitlistId = 替换为加入候补返回的候补号
@waitlistRequestId = waitlist-demo-001

### 1. 生成验证码
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/code?phone={{phone}}

### 2. 验证码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

### 3. 查询是否已经设置密码
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/password/status
authorization: {{token}}

### 4. 首次设置密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {{token}}

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 5. 手机号密码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 6. 查询演出 1 的票档
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket/of/event/1

### 7. 预约票档 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/reserve/1?requestId={{requestId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 7A. 查询本次预约结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-reservations/{{reservationId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 7B. 查询我的预约记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-reservations/me?current=1&size=10
authorization: {{token}}

### 8. 查询我的订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/me?current=1&size=10
authorization: {{token}}

### 9A. 模拟支付（与取消二选一）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/pay/{{orderId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 9B. 取消订单（与支付二选一）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/cancel/{{orderId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 10A. 售罄后加入候补
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-waitlists/join/1?requestId={{waitlistRequestId}}&useCredits=false
authorization: {{token}}

### 10B. 查询候补结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-waitlists/{{waitlistId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 10C. 查询我的候补记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-waitlists/me?current=1&size=10
authorization: {{token}}

### 10D. 取消排队中的候补
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-waitlists/cancel/{{waitlistId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 11. 退出登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/logout
authorization: {{token}}
